<title>USA: API crude stocks to be released Thurs next 2 weeks.</title>
<headline>API crude stocks to be released Thurs next 2 weeks.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Petroleum Institute said Tuesday that the U.S. crude oil stocks weekly report will be released on Thursday the next two weeks due to the Christmas and New Year's holidays</p>
<p>The API reports will be released on December 26 and January 2. The report will go back to its usual Tuesday release day on January 7, an API spokesperson said.</p>
</text>
